+    attention, both of which are Hopper/Blackwell (SM90/SM100) only. On Volta
+    (SM70) we fall back to dense MLA, which is the exact reference that the
+    sparse top-k path approximates. Controlled by VLLM_SM70_GLM_DENSE_MLA
+    (default on) and only takes effect on SM70 unless the sparse Volta path
+    is explicitly requested.
+    """
